The '''Spider Ring''' is a {{Rare}} [[Accessory]] that reduces the damage taken from {{mt|Arthropod}} mobs by {{Green|10%}}. It requires {{Coll|Spider Slayer 1}}. It is the upgraded form of the {{Item|Spider Talisman}}, and it can be upgraded to the {{Item|Spider Artifact}}.

